      "value": "I have given up creating tickets in any way or form through their helpdesk as I have a COPPA Violation ticket sitting in there for over a month now, next to multiple Anti Semitism, NSFW and Racist behavior tickets.\n\nI only report stuff now that I can report ingame or directly through website forms, where I hope that they will enable emoji/sticker/print reports through their website soon and not only ingame.\n\nEdit: Seems like mods are lurking here, COPPA Violation tickets have been resolved. I'd still like the functionality to report emoji/prints/stickers and users through the website.\n\nEdit 2: So, all my Anti Semitism, NSFW, Racist behavior/prints/emoji ect tickets have been closed out in favor for the new system. We still don't have the ability to report emojis/stickers/prints or users retroactive through the website. Anybody had luck with sniffing the API if we can query that for reports?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
