      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{68098a4626271974ef4d2775|full_name} We seen the results, 2/3rds of Online / In Game Reports are still ignored.  The VR Chat management thinks they can hide the poor metric clearing with obfuscation in the game menus.  \n\nProposed Solution:\n\n1) If VR Chat wanted to reduce the amount of T&S Reports, they would hire me as the T & S Architect, where after given the access to the core data entities of VR Chat, and allowing me to create the Moderation Models to address the repeat offenders, that with in the first two weeks they would see a 60-70% fall in reports when we are proactive with Data Driven moderation.\n\n2) If we continue the focus on adjusting the system to letting us review uploaded content with an AI filter for Moderation, we could get rid of the 'Sex Act' Emojis, Racist Tagged Stickers and GORE images that we are seeing today.\n\n3) Under architectural leadership, we would have 'Sand Box' testing of suspect Avatars, Honey-Pot Traps for the Racism Trolls and True PERMA-BANS of your largest  trouble makers.\n\n4) Taking it to the Trouble makers...  Data Feeds coming in from from Streaming Platforms and External Social Media would allow VR Chat to face stomp on the fame seeking trolls, letting the platform to be quiet and sane.\n\nI may seem arrogant about how well the moderation methods work, but I have history and the technical knowledge of how it can work.  I've done it before, given enough power VRC can be truly profitable, but only if they address the Trolling Nature of the freeloaders.",
